arkness/943754-police-in-wod?p=953243#post953243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">oh on Crime? thought id ask.<br /> <br /> how far in theft, Wetwork etc, do you think a supernatural could go before getting slammed for potentially breaching the masquerade/veil.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you be more specific in the question?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T10:17:40-07:00","id":953269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/943754-police-in-wod?p=953243#post953243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">oh on Crime? thought id ask.<br /> <br /> how far in theft, Wetwork etc, do you think a supernatural could go before getting slammed for potentially breaching the masquerade/veil.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would say anything that risks discovery and exposure is too far","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T10:44:01-07:00","id":953279,"title":"","content":"I would imagine it could get pretty far, with it only being a Masquerade breech when substantial proof is leaked to the general public. The internet, paradoxically, is one of the best things to happen to the Masquerade as the first place that someone will post a vampire video is YouTube and, because everyone knows about special effects and digital editing, it will be immediately discounted (at best, it will be 'good job with the special effects'). Nowadays, I imagine that major news outlets get hundreds of video files a week on UFOs, Bigfoot, Elvis, etc and either delete them with the rest of the spam or toss them in the trash with the rest of the garbage. I think that the only thing that would be a serious Masquerade breech would be using your powers in a public event, where it would be witnessed by hundreds or thousands of people, and where dozens or hundreds of cell phone videos from the same event would make it more believable than just one wacko posting on YouTube.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T10:53:41-07:00","id":953290,"title":"","content":"but say do you think enough thefts, to be considered &quot;a Crime Wave&quot; or spree, or whatever, woul