2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T18:37:52-07:00","id":955345,"title":"","content":"Im having trouble finding any references to the &quot;Powers&quot; such as they are of the autumn people... even looked through the &quot;autumn people&quot; book and finding it hard to find anything...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T10:02:06-07:00","id":970759,"title":"","content":"oh towards the end of last month, I found a lost wallet, and wound up giving away When I turned it in at a library that I'd looted it for cash<br /> <br /> the police questioned me, and tried to get in contact with the owner<br /> <br /> but couldnt so they let me go and told me if She decided to press charges they'd have to arrest me.<br /> <br /> they let me go without Bail.<br /> <br /> or is that different?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.u